Mandiant's report on UNC5537 is published on Google Cloud's threat intelligence blog. The Snowflake security advisory is Snowflake's own. The two MITRE pages define the techniques behind stages 02 and 04. Four news reports back the further victims the page names: The Register on Advance Auto Parts, BleepingComputer on Neiman Marcus and on Pure Storage, and Route Fifty on the Los Angeles schools.

The background slides name their own sources: the csoh.org glossary and MITRE ATT&CK.

